# codes: R1005
file "default_self.sp" deck
  title "default_self"
  comment " oracle: ngspice-45 runs (scratchpad runs/selfdef): outer.cir, selfplus.cir (a head default reading its own name reads the enclosing t: i = -5e-4, -2.5e-4); later.cir, earlier.cir (another formal is the formal); mutual.cir (a cycle stops ngspice)"
  param t = 2k
  subckt s (a b) t=(t? * 2) w=l l=1k
    element resistor r1 (a b) value=t
  opaque ngspice invalid ".subckt m a w={l} l={w}\n.ends"
